 "children": [],
 "inter": [],
 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "RTL registers every pin (g4: each port is a pin flop + reach relays, gen_vms_glue_tiles.py DB / DD / DC): bank-side inputs land on the tile landing flops (eg / pr / xq_done / xq2_done / status / flt) and bank-side outputs leave from the tile relay flops (xq / xq2 / pq); the hub captures cq / client_seq / bank_client / response_seq / enables on plain flops and drives cr from flops; both ring stops capture l_in / tx controls and drive l_out / mirror_busy / fault from flops; status drives vmstat from a flop; sid lands on flops. A synthesis pin stage would add an edge the contract (gen_vms_glue_tiles.py) does not have."
 },
 "io_flop_at_pins": {
  "cols": 4,
  "allow_none": true
 },
 "inhold": true,
 "outhold": true,
 "keep_pin_regs": true,
 "pin_reg_split": true,
 "hold_pad": {
  "cell": "HB2xp67_ASAP7_75t_R"
 },
 "purpose": "OWNERS-HBM/VM-GLUE + HBM-KITS-C/VMGLUE 2026-10-18 g2 + HOURLY-HBM/HH-3 g3 + HBM-SAFE-VMGLUE g4 10-19 (HBM d4g plan (b), glue goes into a hardened tile): VM hub glue tile for NW (hb_vms_NW) = hfd_vms_glue_core_lt (ot_vms_hub_lt + 2 ot_vms_rstop_lt + ot_vms_rcl_lt + ot_vms_status_static), the 8 banks are die-level instances. g3 = the g2 setup fix: ring stop bit-sliced per lane band (per-band tx control / header decode copies, rce lane-OR tree), hub request scatter and response gather registered per bank face group, replay select replicated, 7 reset regions. Tile top hfd_hgi_vms_glue_nw_t (gen_vms_glue_tiles.py): one clock, per-bank and per-lane ring ports, one landing / relay stage on every bank-side port (COMMIT_DELAY 8). Contract vs the historical glue: bank-side ports +1 each way; g3 stop inputs +1, rce +2, hub pq +1, pr / response enables +1; reset release +3 (lockstep bench vs <tile>_ref). g4 (SAFE-DESIGN checklist): reach stages (no single-cycle wire > ~405 um): bank-side ports pin flop + 2 relays (xq_done + 3, COMMIT_DELAY 13), hub client ports pin flop + 2 relays, hub <-> ring-stop relays (pi / ri / cco / rce / faults +1), stop inputs +2 with per-half relay copies, 3-level rce tree; registered one-hot schedule selects (bank / tx / replay); 11 reset regions; reset_landing on.",
 "pin_density_per_um": {
  "E": 5.76,
  "W": 3.62,
  "N": 4.46,
  "S": 4.38
 },
